Logged PW-2231: driver app crashes on Android 14 when opening the manifest from a push notification. Numbered repro steps:

1. Android 14, app 3.3.0
2. Receive the "new manifest" push
3. Tap the notification instead of opening the app first
4. Crash (stack trace attached in the ticket, ~80% repro rate on two test devices)

Not reproducible on Android 13. Looks like a notification-intent handling issue. It's filed as P2 but I'd argue P1 given drivers tap notifications by reflex.

